Z||000004||Predator||04-19-2001||12:17 PM||||That sounds like a really good deal. I paid over 1,400.00 just to have the Fuel regulator rebuilt, exhaust manifolds ported out since they were off the car anyway for the head gaskets, new head gaskets, and fuel injectors cleaned. I paid another 1,000 to have my Turbo rebuilt and reinstalled. <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero4_1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000005||HarryG||04-19-2001||12:37 PM||||If it were me...<P>1. I'd ask them for a list of local customers and make some calls and/or visits to the people on that list.<P>2. Ask for a tour of their shop.<P>3. Check them out with the Better Business Bureau.<P>Did they give you a spec sheet on exactly what they replace/rebuild?<P>Just my .02...<P> ||||reg||1
